      "dir": "benchmark/cases/A/cases-order-status",
      "source": "prose",
      "promptMarkdown": "Write test cases for the user story below.\n\nStory ORD-4: Order status changes\n\nAs a store operator, I want every order to move through a fixed set of statuses, so that customers and staff always see where an order is.\n\nAn order is created with the status Placed.\n\n- AC-1: Recording a payment on a Placed order changes its status to Paid.\n- AC-2: Marking a Paid order as shipped changes its status to Shipped.\n- AC-3: Confirming delivery of a Shipped order changes its status to Delivered.\n- AC-4: A Placed or Paid order can be cancelled; its status becomes Cancelled.\n- AC-5: Cancelling a Shipped order is refused with \"Shipped orders cannot be cancelled.\"\n\nWhere information is missing, state your assumption and continue; do not ask questions. Reply with the deliverable only, as Markdown, starting at its first line, with no introduction and no code fence around it. Do not create or edit files.",
      "runsPerCase": 3,
      "timeoutSeconds": 600,
      "maxTurns": 15,
      "graders": [
        {
          "name": "con-every-ac",
          "type": "regex",
          "weight": 1,
          "config": {
            "target": "last_message",
            "pattern": "^(?=[\\s\\S]*\\bAC[- ]?0?1\\b)(?=[\\s\\S]*\\bAC[- ]?0?2\\b)(?=[\\s\\S]*\\bAC[- ]?0?3\\b)(?=[\\s\\S]*\\bAC[- ]?0?4\\b)(?=[\\s\\S]*(?:\\bAC[- ]?0?5\\b|Shipped orders cannot be cancelled))",
            "flags": "i",
            "match": "contains"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "con-technique-named",
          "type": "regex",
          "weight": 1,
          "config": {
            "target": "last_message",
            "pattern": "State[- ]Transition",
            "flags": "i",
            "match": "contains"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "con-unlisted-invalid-transition",
          "type": "regex",
          "weight": 1,
          "config": {
            "target": "last_message",
            "pattern": "(?:\\bship(?:s|ping)?\\b|\\bmark\\w* (?:it |the order )?as shipped)[^\\n]{0,200}(?:\\bPlaced\\b|\\bunpaid\\b|\\bnot (?:yet )?paid\\b|\\bwithout (?:a )?payment\\b)|(?:\\bPlaced\\b|\\bunpaid\\b|\\bnot (?:yet )?paid\\b|\\bwithout (?:a )?payment\\b)[^\\n]{0,200}(?:\\bship(?:s|ping)?\\b|\\bmark\\w* (?:it |the order )?as shipped)",
